  "Luxembourg's imports in 2025 totaled 25.10 billion euros.",
  "The main product chapters were Vehicles and parts at 13.2%, Machinery and mechanical appliances at 11.5%, and Mineral fuels and oils at 8.9%.",
  "Together, the top three import categories accounted for 33.6% of total imports.",
  "Other products made up 38.1% of imports, while confidential items represented 0.1%.",
  "The values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, and 5.0% of the import value is confidential at full product detail."
